Dear Dr. Nambiar,

We are writing to advise that the annual health checkup for your patient
Marcus Ellery (MRN-47892), conducted on 15 April 2026, has returned
results outside the normal range for hepatic function markers.

Specifically:
  ALT: 187 U/L (reference 10–40 U/L; 4.7× upper limit of normal)
  AST: 124 U/L (reference 10–40 U/L; 3.1× upper limit of normal)

Per our clinical advisory protocol, values exceeding 3× ULN are flagged
for immediate GP notification and specialist referral consideration.

The full checkup report (PDF) has been uploaded to the secure portal and
is available at: checkup_reports/checkup_report_ACH-2026-0415-ME47.pdf

An HTML version is also attached for quick review.

We recommend urgent follow-up within 48 hours.

Regards,
